# picasso-suite
===
 Non-linear video editor written in Rust (egui) with a DaVinci Resolve-style interface: Cut, Edit and Deliver pages, all-format support via FFmpeg, H.264/H.265 export and .drp project import. Windows, Linux and macOS.
